# Remote Control environments to (re)create on every `make provision`.
# One per line:  <name> [git-url] [remote-add options]
# <name> becomes ~/work/<name> and the environment name in the Claude app.
# Blank lines and # comments are ignored. Applied by bootstrap.sh step_remotes,
# which runs remote-add for each entry (idempotent). Servers only start once
# `claude auth login` has been done; the clone and trust happen regardless.
workbench https://github.com/msavdert/workbench.git
ai-hub https://github.com/msavdert/ai-hub.git
dba-to-dbre https://github.com/msavdert/dba-to-dbre.git
suhuf https://github.com/msavdert/suhuf.git
